Third-party provenance and unresolved permission
-----------------------------------------------
The DSP work adapts gdyuldin/x6100_base_patch r13, including the contributions
of Georgy Dyuldin (R2RFE) and other upstream contributors:
https://github.com/gdyuldin/x6100_base_patch/tree/644ac675a1765ce69755870767b4cb00a3e6d7eb
Upstream credits KI9NG for the CESSB idea.

Affected material retained here:
  - src/tx_dsp.c: CESSB/compressor adaptation from Core/Src/cessb.c and
    Core/Src/compressor.c, with port-specific state, mixing and optimizations.
  - firmware/tx_interpolation.c: the 64-coefficient table from fir_ssb_cw_8.txt,
    reversed and rounded to float32 as upstream patch.py does.
  - tests/test_tx_dsp.c: reference CESSB/compressor implementations associated
    with the adapted DSP behavior.

